<div style="width:1366px;height:768px;overflow:hidden">

<header class="face">
  <div class="brand">
    <div class="mark">LOG</div>
    <div>
      <h1>つなぐ工房</h1>
      <div class="sub">LOGIC WORKSHOP ／ スイッチ・AND・OR・NOT から 加算器 まで</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="leds">
    <div class="led on"><i></i><span>POWER</span></div>
    <div class="led"><i></i><span>RUN</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="ctl">
    <span class="btn run">▶ 運転にする</span>
    <span class="btn ghost">はじめから</span>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="statusbar">
  <div class="st"><span class="k">MODE</span><span class="v">編集</span></div>
  <div class="st"><span class="k">LESSON</span><span class="v">2 / 9</span></div>
  <div class="st"><span class="k">PARTS</span><span class="v">3</span></div>
  <div class="st"><span class="k">WIRES</span><span class="v">3</span></div>
  <div class="st"><span class="k">OPEN</span><span class="v">つなぎ残し 1</span></div>
  <div class="st ver"><span class="k">VER</span><span class="v">2026-09-14a</span></div>
</div>

<nav class="tabs">
  <div class="tabrow">
    <div class="grplab">キホン</div>
    <div class="tab done">1 スイッチ</div>
    <div class="tab now">2 直列</div>
    <div class="tab">3 並列</div>
    <div class="tab">4 NOT</div>
    <div class="tab">5 真理値表</div>
  </div>
  <div class="tabrow">
    <div class="grplab">カダイ</div>
    <div class="tab">6 XOR</div>
    <div class="tab">7 半加算器</div>
    <div class="tab">8 全加算器</div>
    <div class="tab">9 4ビット</div>
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="cols">
  <main>
    <div class="panel goal">
      <h2>課題2　二つのスイッチを一本の道でつなぐ</h2>
      <p>スイッチ A と スイッチ B を、電池からランプまで <b>一本道</b> に並べなさい。<br>
         どちらか片方だけ入れても、ランプは点きません。</p>
      <p class="hint">ランプの左がわの端子が、まだどこにもつながっていません。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="panel board edit">
      <div class="secthead">
        <span class="sectk">STEP 1</span>
        <span class="sectt">回路をつくる</span>
        <span class="sectstate">編集モード<br>端子をタップ → つなぎ先をタップ</span>
      </div>
      <div class="wirewrap">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 700 300" width="100%" height="300" role="img" aria-label="配線盤">
          <rect x="30" y="30" width="6" height="240" rx="2" fill="#5d564a"/>
          <rect x="664" y="30" width="6" height="240" rx="2" fill="#5d564a"/>
          <text x="33" y="22" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace" font-size="10" fill="#948b77">＋</text>
          <text x="667" y="22" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace" font-size="10" fill="#948b77">−</text>

          <line x1="36" y1="150" x2="156" y2="150" stroke="#9a917d" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="224" y1="150" x2="336" y2="150" stroke="#9a917d" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <line x1="569" y1="150" x2="664" y2="150" stroke="#9a917d" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>

          <line x1="404" y1="150" x2="521" y2="150" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="4" stroke-dasharray="9 7" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.85"/>

          <g>
            <circle cx="156" cy="150" r="5" fill="#3d3830"/>
            <circle cx="224" cy="150" r="5" fill="#3d3830"/>
            <line x1="156" y1="150" x2="212" y2="126" stroke="#3d3830" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <text x="190" y="108" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#6d6555">A</text>
          </g>
          <g>
            <circle cx="336" cy="150" r="5" fill="#3d3830"/>
            <circle cx="404" cy="150" r="9" fill="none" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="3"/>
            <circle cx="404" cy="150" r="5" fill="#2563eb"/>
            <line x1="336" y1="150" x2="392" y2="126" stroke="#3d3830" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <text x="370" y="108" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#6d6555">B</text>
          </g>
          <g>
            <circle cx="545" cy="150" r="24" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#3d3830" stroke-width="4"/>
            <line x1="528" y1="133" x2="562" y2="167" stroke="#3d3830" stroke-width="3"/>
            <line x1="528" y1="167" x2="562" y2="133" stroke="#3d3830" stroke-width="3"/>
            <circle cx="521" cy="150" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#2563eb" stroke-width="3"/>
            <circle cx="569" cy="150" r="5" fill="#3d3830"/>
            <text x="545" y="108" text-anchor="middle" font-family="ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace" font-size="13" font-weight="700" fill="#6d6555">Y</text>
          </g>

          <g>
            <rect x="404" y="186" width="128" height="26" rx="7" fill="#2563eb"/>
            <text x="468" y="204" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Noto Sans JP,sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="700" fill="#ffffff">つなぎ先をタップ</text>
          </g>

          <g fill="#cdc5b4" font-family="ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace" font-size="15" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle">
            <circle cx="96" cy="150" r="11" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e0d9ca"/><text x="96" y="155">＋</text>
            <circle cx="280" cy="150" r="11" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e0d9ca"/><text x="280" y="155">＋</text>
            <circle cx="616" cy="150" r="11" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e0d9ca"/><text x="616" y="155">＋</text>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <aside>
    <div class="panel board">
      <div class="blab">ブヒンバコ</div>
      <div class="devrow">
        <div class="xbtn">SW<span class="tag">スイッチ</span></div>
        <div class="xbtn">Y<span class="tag">ランプ</span></div>
        <div class="xbtn">／<span class="tag">導線</span></div>
        <div class="xbtn">×<span class="tag">けす</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="note">この課題で使う部品だけを出しています。AND・OR・NOT は課題5から出てきます。</div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel">
      <div class="blab">シンリチヒョウ</div>
      <table class="tt">
        <tr><th>A</th><th>B</th><th class="sep">Y</th></tr>
        <tr class="todo"><td>0</td><td>0</td><td class="sep">−</td></tr>
        <tr class="todo"><td>0</td><td>1</td><td class="sep">−</td></tr>
        <tr class="todo"><td>1</td><td>0</td><td class="sep">−</td></tr>
        <tr class="todo"><td>1</td><td>1</td><td class="sep">−</td></tr>
      </table>
      <div class="note">運転モードでスイッチを切りかえると、その組み合わせの行が埋まります。</div>
    </div>

    <div class="btnrow">
      <span class="btn run">▶ 運転にする</span>
      <span class="btn ghost">ヒント</span>
      <span class="btn off">たしかめる</span>
    </div>
  </aside>
</div>

</div>
</x-dc>
</body>
</html>
